WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,120
Chenggong Weibo Factory urgently purchased and deployed nearly 10,000 kilograms of various grains

2
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:06,360
Effectively alleviate the pressure on food supply

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,720
Guarantee the order of production and life

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:11,200
After research and decision by the factory leadership team

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,840
Guests commended Comrade Qin Tian through the whole meeting

6
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,960
And a reward of RMB 150 yuan

7
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:24,780
Well done Qin Purchasing

8
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,260
Comrade Qin Tian, thank you for your hard work.

9
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:32,090
Brother Qin, you are really famous now

10
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:34,250
From now on, I can eat freely wherever I go in the factory.

11
00:00:35,250 --> 00:00:38,920
Reputation, bonus, and relationship with factory leaders

12
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,920
It’s all confidence for me

13
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,920
But the more famous I am, the more people will stare at me.

14
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,920
Be more careful when doing things in the future

15
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:50,140
There is a sudden problem with the food supply this time

16
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:52,170
It will never only affect the machine factory

17
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:54,840
If it continues to spread

18
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,840
The real trouble lies behind

19
00:00:56,840 --> 00:01:00,540
I don’t know if Xiao Xi heard the broadcast.
